  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4501.12 \"Willing\" in the context of \"fit, willing and able\" means an applicant intends to comply with the applicable statutes, rules, and federal regulations, for the duration of the permit or certificate.\n\nSource. #5853, eff 6-23-94; ss by #7239, eff 6-23-00, EXPIRED: 6-23-08\n\nNew. #9378, eff 1-30-09; ss by #12357, eff 8-2-17",
